From b7b5b30cc2a9b6ea8d82adca75e05bf7d03a8a30 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 12:24:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www: the Security Posture card keeps both columns, the shell
 topbar wraps on phones, the Warden list boxes stack at 400 px, the setup
 box's login rows keep their layout

Four layout fixes from field screenshots (2026-10-02/03).

- Main_ReaperDash.asp: the Security Posture card cut off its right column
  ("cut off in Safari"; reproduced in Chromium at the same widths - the window
  width is the variable, not the engine). .rows.two was "1fr 1fr", and a 1fr
  track is minmax(auto,1fr): the Wi-Fi Encryption row's 300 px nowrap
  sub-label floored the first column and .card{overflow:hidden} hid the second
  column's tags below ~1500 px (42 px hidden at 1440, 215 at 1181; the col12
  band 905-1090; phones through the <=900 single-column rule). Now
  repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)) and minmax(0,1fr) in the 900 rule, .srow .l>div
  {min-width:0}, the tag flex:0 0 auto; a truncated .sub2 label carries its
  full text as a tooltip (rtip, reaperTips() after paintPosture). Measured on
  the mock at 1920/1440/1366/1000/390: 0 overflow.
- reaper_shell.asp: every phone narrower than 481 px laid the whole shell out
  at 481 and clipped the right edge of every framed page - the topbar is a
  nowrap row (brand 248 + help + REBOOT + LOGOUT) and the 1fr app column
  floored at its min-content. minmax(0,1fr) on the column; the topbar wraps
  with the brand left and the buttons right-aligned on their own line.
- Reaper_Warden.asp: .duo was repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr)), so at a
  768 px tablet or a narrow shell iframe the Manual block list and Whitelist
  boxes sat side by side at ~300 px each. Now minmax(min(100%,400px),1fr): one
  full-width column whenever a box would be under 400 px; desktop keeps two
  inside the page's 1120 px cap.
- Reaper_WiFiSetup.asp: v3.3.2 wrapped the credential rows in a <form>, so
  they stopped being direct children of .main_content and lost the 78 px label
  column and the 22 px row gap (GT-BE98 screenshot). The layout rule matches
  .main_content > form > div too.

Gates: jscheck ok, hiddencheck no fatal, static_checks 13/13, csrfcheck 0
breakers; verify_markers lines for the posture grid and the rtip rows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
